      <EnumInfo>
        <Text>UseOffsetAndDistance</Text>
        <Enum>0</Enum>
        <Comment>Starting at the given offset the mover positions are generated with a fixed distance to each other.</Comment>
      </EnumInfo>
      <EnumInfo>
        <Text>UseMoverParameters</Text>
        <Enum>1</Enum>
        <Comment>The positions of the movers are set to the values defined by the simulation parameters of the mover objects.</Comment>
      </EnumInfo>
      <EnumInfo>
        <Text>UseRandomDistribution</Text>
        <Enum>2</Enum>
        <Comment>The positions of the movers are defined randomly - the specified mover distance is taken as the minimal distance between movers.</Comment>
      </EnumInfo>
